Package: bustalab
Title: Busta Lab Tools Built on 'phylochemistry'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lucas", "Busta", email = "bust0037@d.umn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lab tools for the Busta lab: the full-featured GC-MS / GC-TCD peak
    integration app, a GenomeScope genome-size estimator, a client for the lab's
    'dgx' language-model servers, and cached download helpers for lab reference
    datasets. Attaching this package also attaches 'phylochemistry'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/thebustalab/phylochemistry
